SUMMARY:[Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos][Complex Systems & Network Science] Dyn
 amics Days Europe 2026 - Extended minisymposium proposal deadline (cutoff
  time unannounced)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Dynamics Days Europe\nWebsite: https://dde-20
 26.sci-meet.net/\nSource URL: https://dde-2026.sci-meet.net/important-dat
 es\nLocation: Lisbon\, Portugal\nTopics: Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos\, Com
 plex Systems & Network Science\, Time Series & Sequential Data\, System I
 dentification & Data-driven Dynamics\nSize: L\nSubmission type: Abstract-
 based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-08\nNotes: Histo
 rical annual meeting. Contributions are talk/poster abstracts collected i
 n a book of abstracts\, not standard full-paper proceedings. Minisymposiu
 m organization is a separate non-contribution milestone. Abstract submitt
 ers had to complete fee payment by May 29. Exact cutoff hours were unanno
 unced. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Theory and applications of 
 nonlinear dynamics: chaos\, bifurcations\, synchronization\, pattern form
 ation\, complex networks\, stochastic dynamics and time-series analysis. 
 ML and neurodynamics are characteristic interdisciplinary extensions. Con
 tributed talks and posters use abstracts\, while minisymposium proposals 
 are organizer activity.\nAdditional topics: Machine Learning\, Computatio
 nal Neuroscience\, Control & Robotics\, Graphs & Graph Learning\nScope so
 urces (2026): https://dde-2026.sci-meet.net/abstract-submission-2\nScope 
 last checked: 2026-10-08\nOfficial deadline day\; exact cutoff hour/timez
 one is unannounced. Verify the organizer's submission portal.
URL:https://dde-2026.sci-meet.net/important-dates
END:VEVENT
